  "action_resolution": "All fourteen intents are legal for an awake role; inapplicable interactions are deterministic no-ops. A stunned role and a terminal state allow only 0. Out-of-range or masked actions map to 0. Movement resolves simultaneously against walls, previous occupied cells, duplicate targets and enemy refuge admission; swaps are blocked. Existing decoys move before new launches. Guards resolve simultaneously after movement and decoy updates: each distracted guard destroys its nearest hostile decoy and captures nobody; other guards tag every adjacent awake enemy outside its refuge. Mutual captures are allowed. Captured cargo drops before teleport. Pickup, banking, handoff and voluntary drop then resolve in cyclic role order starting at t mod 4. Capture returns to a fixed refuge berth, where temporary friendly co-location is permitted; no global unique-agent-position invariant is asserted.",
  "rng_contract": "Reset and all transitions are deterministic and ignore the supplied keys. The exact declared seed/fold-in schedule remains replay provenance. No local model, hidden RNG or process state is consulted.",
  "event_visibility_note": "Per-step event arrays bind agent_visible. Role views must hide events attributed to invisible patrols, even though public scores reveal delivery totals. Full capture/deployment/handoff event identity belongs only to the labelled debug view when its participant is hidden. A scout signal must not be treated as full agent visibility.",
  "scientific_status": "AUTHORED_NOT_EXECUTED_NOT_R0_ACCEPTED",
  "adapter_boundary": "This package supplies the native fixed-array kernel. Agent-keyed JaxMARL adapter, __all__, real replay and presentation acceptance are separate integration deliverables; no frozen learner is replaced."
